      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "A music concert lasts exactly $1\\,\\text{h}.$ What is this time in minutes?",
      "worked_solution": "A table showing the units of time is given below.\n\n| Name | Symbol | Conversion |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Second | $\\text{s}$ | $-$ |\n| Minute | $\\text{min}$ | $1\\,\\text{min}=60\\,\\text{s}$ |\n| Hour | $\\text{h}$ | $1\\,\\text{h}=60\\,\\text{min}$ |\n| Day | $-$ | $1\\,\\text{day}=24\\,\\text{h}$ |\n| Week | $-$ | $1\\,\\text{week}=7\\,\\text{days}$ |\n\nTherefore, $1\\,\\text{h}$ is equivalent to $60\\,\\text{min}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
